{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857950/extras/4709ab1ff428e9f9594bbf3677b02dc5.poster.avif?t=1762135136\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857950/extras/4709ab1ff428e9f9594bbf3677b02dc5.webm?t=1762135136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857950/extras/4709ab1ff428e9f9594bbf3677b02dc5.mp4?t=1762135136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258cStory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DUNGEON&quot;\u2014a realm brimming with dreams, hope, and romance, the ultimate playground for daring adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The martial artist in training, &quot;Maika&quot;, is challenging this dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon she braves holds treasures left by legendary martial artists...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Maika ventures through the dungeon, a floor with an eerie, unfamiliar atmosphere suddenly emerges...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Maika's tale of facing a deadly trap in the dungeon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258cHow to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\u25b2 Catch every anomaly! </strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857950/extras/9c65ca4ba3b1aa88a1762580125224da.avif?t=1762135136\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Guidelines\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.At 0, no changes occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Beyond 0, stay sharp\u2014don't miss a single anomaly. (Hold your nerve until the very end.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.If you detect an anomaly, turn back immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.If everything seems normal, press forward without hesitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.After reaching 7 with no anomalies spotted, you're free to break out of the trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\u25b2 Keep missing anomalies, and...</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857950/extras/f536a66a6ab908c59ed42e5a10256891.avif?t=1762135136\" width=600 height=334 /></span>\u3010Warnings\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Never tamper with the anomalies...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Overlook them, and...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might just become part of the trap yourself...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258cGame Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 5 endings, including 4 steamy, erotic BAD ENDS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All H scenes are fully animated for immersive, heart-pounding excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 5\u201310 thrilling minutes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857950?t=1762135136","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857950/243cc7c67962838f967682ad86c4b1b54657ca60/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762135136","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857950/c77250c9356f6e7a159a47428473f4cc8624b266/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762135136","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857950/c77250c9356f6e7a159a47428473f4cc8624b266/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762135136","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Fam